%!PS
% SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 EfterScript contributors
% SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
% oracle: colour
% Scenario: a converted colour under save and restore. The colour set in
% a non-collapsing space before save is what restore brings back: the
% second fill is painted with the first colour's L*a*b* again, the
% conversion having run when the colour was set.
[/CIEBasedA <<
  /WhitePoint [0.9505 1 1.089]
  /DecodeA {2 exp} bind
  /MatrixA [0.47525 0.5 0.5445]
>>] setcolorspace
0.8 setcolor
/snapshot save def
0.2 setcolor
100 100 200 100 rectfill
snapshot restore
100 300 200 100 rectfill
showpage
